            <ArticleTitle>[Single and sequential aorto-coronary bypass: comparison of patency rate].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1649-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postoperative angiography was performed in 222 patients who had undergone aorto-coronary bypass grafting. Double sequential grafts show the highest patency rate (90%), followed by single (77%) and multiple (65%) sequential grafts.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
